tall(dk(r)) on f(o): r does not apply to the argument o (REM: no result).
(The META traversal path, a strategy term tone(S) evaluated by strat[X],
has only negative programs (runtimetraversal) but one, runtimetraversal_app:
strat[X] defines only tone, applied to the application term [S]a, so it
gives a result only when a is itself an application term.)
